      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "二、非交互式分区流程"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "二非交互式分区流程"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.1 创建分区表（GPT）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "21-创建分区表gpt"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "parted /dev/vdb mklabel gpt"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.2 将硬盘所有容量分给主分区"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "22-将硬盘所有容量分给主分区"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "parted /dev/vdb mkpart primary 0% 100%"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.3 查询磁盘已有分区"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "23-查询磁盘已有分区"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "parted /dev/vdb print"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.4 查询硬盘分区（备选）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "24-查询硬盘分区备选"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "fdisk -l\n# or\nlsblk"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.5 格式化分区"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "25-格式化分区"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "mkfs.ext4 /dev/vdb1"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.6 创建分区标签"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "26-创建分区标签"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "e2label /dev/vdb1 \"DataPart\"\n# e2label /dev/vdb1 \"LogPart\""
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.7 查询 /dev/vdb1 的 blkid（分区 UUID）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "27-查询-devvdb1-的-blkid分区-uuid"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "blkid /dev/vdb1"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.8 修改 /etc/fstab 实现开机自动挂载"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "28-修改-etcfstab-实现开机自动挂载"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "vi /etc/fstab"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "添加条目："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "ini",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "LABEL=\"DataPart\"\t/data\text4\tdefaults\t0\t0\n# LABEL=\"LogPart\"\t/log\text4\tdefaults\t0\t0"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.9 挂载文件系统并验证"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "29-挂载文件系统并验证"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "mount -a\ndf -h"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "三、一键分区脚本（disk.sh）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "三一键分区脚本disksh"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "#!/bin/bash\nDiskPath=$1\n\nparted ${DiskPath} mklabel gpt\necho \"mklabel gpt\"\n\nparted ${DiskPath} mkpart primary 0% 100%\necho \"mkpart primary\"\n\nparted ${DiskPath} print\necho \"print\"\n\nfdisk -l\necho \"fdisk -l\"\n\nmkfs.ext4 ${DiskPath}1\necho \"mkfs.ext4\"\n\ne2label ${DiskPath}1 \"DataPart\"\necho \"e2label\"\n\nblkid ${DiskPath}1\necho \"blkid\"\n\necho \"LABEL=\\\"DataPart\\\"\\t/data\\text4\\tdefaults,nodelalloc,noatime\\t0\\t2\" >> /etc/fstab\necho \"update /etc/fstab\"\n\nmkdir /data\nmount -a\ndf -h\necho \"success\""
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "使用："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "chmod 755 disk.sh\n./disk.sh /dev/vdb"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "⚠️ 脚本以传入磁盘路径为 $1，执行前请确认磁盘盘符正确，避免误格式化。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
